{"about_the_game":"In the demo version of Fantasy Idle Dungeon, you will assemble and train your very own team of Jelings. Gain resources continuously through idle battles, then use them to make your Jelings stronger, challenge higher-level dungeons, and unlock and collect even more unique Jelings.<br><br>This is a light yet strategic adventure\u2014come and discover your best team composition!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><br><strong>Collect and Train Jelings:</strong> Discover and nurture Jelings with different styles to build your exclusive squad.<br><strong>Free Attribute Allocation:</strong> Distribute stat points as you like to create Jelings that fit your tactics.<br><strong>Flexible Talent Combinations:</strong> Mix and match talents to unlock endless battle possibilities.<br><strong>Equipment System:</strong> Collect and enhance gear to boost your Jelings\u2019 power.<br><br>In the full version, you will also experience unique out-of-battle progression and Jeling fusion mechanics!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451640?t=1758118668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758118668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451640/24840cb1ba67b16b15b6f18980589eebe6840dec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758118668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451640/24840cb1ba67b16b15b6f18980589eebe6840dec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758118668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"In the demo version of Fantasy Idle Dungeon, you will assemble and train your very own team of Jelings. Gain resources continuously through idle battles, then use them to make your Jelings stronger, challenge higher-level dungeons, and unlock and collect even mor